{"job_id":"F-b4dd72f3589bca372839","family_id":"F-b4dd72f3589bca372839","title":"국방정신전력원령","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-012429-223181-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":8,"target_id":"c6d22c334042f93322bd531d7bb4eaf3df52b4bb705baede5fad30c356b41fb2","source_hash":"3dce62452c8bc02f1b641fed693f3401dc367aa6fe1068ee5a16f1ef067652c9","text":"国防精神力指令"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-012429-223181-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":86,"target_id":"6a23c4f57fd328379bec3ad78cad43d6bef28a7649d869f096d7c8b58b04fa47","source_hash":"2a1b65a66541829ec6268d0534689584cbd20dc56dddff3e2ba34bbd76571491","text":"第一条（设立）在国防部长领导下设立国防精神力量研究所，进行增强军队精神力量的教育，并研究发展相关理论。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-012429-223181-ko","scope":"BODY","start":86,"end":223,"target_id":"f1acd1e8b9edacff99ffd2d24f7fd4419c7bfcf68bedb4da5c27a33da1081456","source_hash":"78fcfc5a3cbca8b97f10ce9819426b8b1f3c3b28ace8a02074396ae6265ba85e","text":"第二条（使命）国防精神力量研究所应执行下列各款规定的使命。\n1. 树立国家安全观念和培养军人精神的教育职责\n2. 心理战理论研究和作战发展工作\n3. 军事人员心理教育相关内容的开发和制作\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-012429-223181-ko","scope":"BODY","start":223,"end":355,"target_id":"c3152f2b839db327fe7d2bafc91a7b0808f5ba24c31519a8b74043420a458de0","source_hash":"2e2ff40aac685895015aa215d00a7a1ea0e53e630bb24385f6f24140b8f4f09a","text":"第三条（主任）\n① 国防精神力量研究所设所长一职，所长应从二级以上文职军人中选任。<2017年9月5日修订，2020年12月1日再次修订>\n主任奉国防部长之命，负责监督国防精神力量研究所的事务，并指挥和监督其附属部门。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-012429-223181-ko","scope":"BODY","start":355,"end":421,"target_id":"97c882f906491fb0d732f99b2f5c0a0b4e022babb67cc6afc035117bd2ee6c9c","source_hash":"497b1a2e2eefd68f8aa2d4cbf4d9d3aa40d434c2f66cbd9121357d6b8ae5e5f8","text":"第四条（部门的设立） 为国防精神力量研究所设立必要的部门，其组织和职责划分等事宜由国防部长决定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-012429-223181-ko","scope":"BODY","start":421,"end":495,"target_id":"29e5acec78306dcced0b157e487b370ef82b85d61240d201b35e863551b7c53b","source_hash":"64f1573774bfbdd60fc2ca3d23f076f17614f4aabf50b34d671863537174620c","text":"第五条（课程等）国防部长应决定国防精神力量研究所的课程、课时及其他必要事项。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-012429-223181-ko","scope":"BODY","start":495,"end":565,"target_id":"c99ad1dd93534ffe523f29a4d4da2852501c80f36371a0f4f05b6210b4fa209e","source_hash":"02fca2512d414cf976b86886f4a314aa2521d6b0654c8940899eb384946708a4","text":"第六条（教员）国防精神力量研究所应当任命教员，教员的资格标准和任命程序等事宜，由国防部长决定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-012429-223181-ko","scope":"BODY","start":565,"end":614,"target_id":"eb784300c807c1980f3a5700f17a9914dd148a3e963a7604061eb0628a6da8c0","source_hash":"96772b7f1120fad94580fe13d03ef0ad47759aa02165a83d77ee5786756f7011","text":"第七条（人员配额）国防精神力量研究所应当聘用军人和文职人员，人员配额由国防部长决定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-012429-223181-ko","scope":"BODY","start":614,"end":639,"target_id":"01828efc47fd95ff56901f799afede0cddf2e4c060b45225345e244065f2626b","source_hash":"00d328cfbbbfd496168c3022f24b8e1725eb4977433c001b50bf9ea4b1e77a95","text":"补充规定 <第26771号，2015年12月30日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-012429-223181-ko","scope":"BODY","start":639,"end":674,"target_id":"d462bb20fe37557588475966971b407ee645271bd690bf41e94bd86a8c122fba","source_hash":"1b4a9f42596c35607286f3bda30c6d979e712a24405f3e10e5b17259cca580d6","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自2016年1月1日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-012429-223181-ko","scope":"BODY","start":674,"end":805,"target_id":"eabfc9aeb22b2d5ee9a926bc705b3dd06fd9f8d2e3cab781ac2178f06d2c89e3","source_hash":"3ded542bc3e5079b07fb02086c96c1d00214446f9091c52ff8345fbb4666ee45","text":"第二条（修改其他法律）①《国防改革法实施令》部分修改如下。\n\n  第十九条第一款新增第二十款，内容如下。\n\n    20. 国防精神力量研究所所长\n\n  ② 联合军事大学法令部分修改如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00012","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-012429-223181-ko","scope":"BODY","start":805,"end":1053,"target_id":"3e5dee3ea08bfb1554df328ef9f6fa2b425c71f47859d6caa26526d60913428d","source_hash":"44809a965407554bc05425b9dd06341d38fe322d435ce709ce64e6a4750e96ae","text":"  第 1 条中的“精神战力量和语言”应改为“语言”。\n\n  删除第二条第二款第二项。\n\n  第 4-2 条第 2 款和第 3 款如下。\n\n    ② 国防语言学院隶属于联合军事大学，负责开展联合作战和国际军事交流所需的语言教育工作。\n\n    ③ 国防语言学院院长应由一名校级军官或一名合同制文职人员担任。\n\n  在第 4-2 条第 4 款中，“单位和国防精神力量研究所”均应改为“单位”。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00013","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-012429-223181-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1053,"end":1086,"target_id":"c7a046df3514ea2720daf8b9a47367f7b899d1c238b34ec6a060fb6009a1a114","source_hash":"46ae83072f863724fe582dfad77d64d08ffc2625dcab5f104235e03aafc9074d","text":"补充规定（《军事人员法》实施令）<第28266号，2017年9月5日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00014","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-012429-223181-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1086,"end":1123,"target_id":"73c20a3176cfde5d9bd958a60b77d97f17dd989ee464be135cc591a6a911283c","source_hash":"7d7075d3fab665cdbaac560b14335b0ee552583c1a51db7e92e263494f72f34f","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。<但书略>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00015","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-012429-223181-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1123,"end":1137,"target_id":"bdc3b01522bf0db21a3c2b7b5000a75e61a67279beae78bbb47cedd398971786","source_hash":"c27a8d90e2fad39db31a7ec7c05311572dbb07d5ec24565e9bc0e8ebd63ca618","text":"第 2 条和第 3 条已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00016","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-012429-223181-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1137,"end":1262,"target_id":"1830b506f2dd84294481544b4c4f5c805956f6ec190bcddb8568001c8c46ea88","source_hash":"0470db3a126061e86af329f71a439f766c45b72134953832ae43cbc3f9db542a","text":"第四条（修改其他法律）①至<31> 已省略\n\n  <32> 国防灵力研究所法令部分内容修订如下。\n\n  第3条第1款中的“部级”应改为“总级”。\n\n  <33> 至 <90> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00017","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-012429-223181-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1262,"end":1312,"target_id":"0e38d681f0605f33ba03956e8a6469ba51c75aeba66daa98a45fdf7845e97508","source_hash":"be9ba843a56d257f442017aaf7ff351d86403b0d2dc11fdd44e6c2650614f06c","text":"补充规定 <第31200号，2020年12月1日>\n\n本法令自2020年12月31日起生效。"}]}